
---
import BaseLayout from '../../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Walking & Cardio | Silken Valley Lifestyle"
  description="Discover walking routines, daily walking habits, cardiovascular exercise, treadmill workouts, outdoor walking, and endurance training."
  heroTitle="Walking & Cardio"
  heroText="Enjoy the benefits of everyday movement, build endurance, and create a healthier, more active lifestyle."
  heroCompact={true}
>
  <section class="hero">
    <p class="eyebrow">Fitness & Active Living</p>
    <h1>Walking, Cardio & Everyday Movement</h1>
    <p>
      Walking is one of the most accessible ways to stay
      active. From a gentle morning stroll to a brisk outdoor
      walk, treadmill session, or structured cardio routine,
      regular movement can become an enjoyable part of
      everyday life.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="walking-intro">
    <h2>The Benefits of Walking & Cardiovascular Exercise</h2>
    <p>
      Cardiovascular activities encourage heart and lung
      fitness, endurance, and overall physical conditioning.
      Walking is a wonderful starting point, while cycling,
      swimming, dancing, and other aerobic activities offer
      additional ways to stay active. Choose activities you
      enjoy and build your routine gradually.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="walking-grid">
    <article class="walking-card">
      <span class="walking-number">01</span>
      <h2>Walking for Fitness</h2>
      <p>
        Walking can be adapted to almost any schedule.
        Whether you prefer a relaxed stroll or a brisk
        fitness walk, regular walks can help develop
        cardiovascular endurance.
      </p>
      <h3>Walking Ideas</h3>
      <ul>
        <li>Enjoy a morning walk before starting the day.</li>
        <li>Take an afternoon walk during a break.</li>
        <li>Explore neighbourhood streets and local parks.</li>
        <li>Walk with friends or family.</li>
        <li>Gradually increase your walking time or distance.</li>
      </ul>
    </article>

    <article class="walking-card">
      <span class="walking-number">02</span>
      <h2>Daily Walking Goals</h2>
      <p>
        Setting a walking goal can provide motivation
        and help establish a consistent routine. Your
        daily target should reflect your current activity
        level and personal circumstances.
      </p>
      <h3>Building a Walking Habit</h3>
      <ul>
        <li>Begin with a realistic daily walking target.</li>
        <li>Use a pedometer or activity tracker if helpful.</li>
        <li>Take short walks throughout the day.</li>
        <li>Keep track of distance, duration, or steps.</li>
        <li>Increase your activity gradually.</li>
      </ul>
    </article>

    <article class="walking-card">
      <span class="walking-number">03</span>
      <h2>Brisk Walking & Endurance</h2>
      <p>
        Brisk walking is a form of moderate-intensity
        aerobic activity. It can be incorporated into
        a routine as your fitness and confidence develop.
      </p>
      <h3>Training Ideas</h3>
      <ul>
        <li>Start with an easy walking warm-up.</li>
        <li>Introduce short periods of brisk walking.</li>
        <li>Alternate comfortable and faster paces.</li>
        <li>Maintain a relaxed, natural stride.</li>
        <li>Finish with a slower cool-down walk.</li>
      </ul>
    </article>

    <article class="walking-card">
      <span class="walking-number">04</span>
      <h2>Treadmill Walking</h2>
      <p>
        A treadmill provides a convenient indoor option
        when weather or scheduling makes outdoor walking
        less practical.
      </p>
      <h3>Treadmill Workout Ideas</h3>
      <ul>
        <li>Begin with a comfortable warm-up pace.</li>
        <li>Try a steady-paced walking session.</li>
        <li>Experiment with gentle incline settings.</li>
        <li>Alternate between easy and brisk intervals.</li>
        <li>Finish with a gradual cool-down.</li>
      </ul>
    </article>

    <article class="walking-card">
      <span class="walking-number">05</span>
      <h2>Outdoor Walking & Nature</h2>
      <p>
        Outdoor walking offers an opportunity to enjoy
        fresh air, natural surroundings, and changing
        scenery while staying active.
      </p>
      <h3>Places to Explore</h3>
      <ul>
        <li>Neighbourhood walking routes.</li>
        <li>Local parks and gardens.</li>
        <li>Lakeside and waterfront paths.</li>
        <li>Nature trails and gentle hills.</li>
        <li>Scenic walking routes and pathways.</li>
      </ul>
    </article>

    <article class="walking-card">
      <span class="walking-number">06</span>
      <h2>Other Cardio Activities</h2>
      <p>
        Walking is only one way to enjoy cardiovascular
        exercise. Mixing activities can add variety
        and help keep your routine interesting.
      </p>
      <h3>Activities to Explore</h3>
      <ul>
        <li>Cycling and stationary biking.</li>
        <li>Swimming and water aerobics.</li>
        <li>Dancing and aerobic classes.</li>
        <li>Elliptical machine workouts.</li>
        <li>Low-impact cardio sessions.</li>
      </ul>
    </article>
  </section>

